From f81e9fbe2adacfef6803ff4c3483339728a23de6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:48:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/15] build(pfm): compile against pinned signature stubs and
 MixinExtras

Add a never-packaged stubs source set with the Fabric 1.20.4 intermediary
and PFM 1.5.0 signatures the PFM performance Mixins call, and compile
against MixinExtras 0.5.0, which Fabric Loader 0.18.4 bundles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
